// Ore storage (WP7.3, docs/rules/economy.md, "Storage"): the harvest scenario's playfield, field
// and rock patch, with storage. Each refinery stores 600 units of ore (three loads) for its owner.
//
// `unit_defs` names the FROZEN copy of WP7.2 (harvest_defs); its refinery has no `storage` field,
// which is why the capacities are written out below (`storage`), as the ore and harvest rules are,
// so editing the shipped unit_defs.ron, harvest.ron or ore.ron never moves this checksum. Kinds:
// 2 refinery, 11 harvester.
//
//   slot 0  the refinery of player 0 on (96, 86), dock point (99.5, 88.5): capacity 600
//   slot 1  a harvester of player 0 on (104, 90), tick 0
//   slot 2  a harvester of player 0 on (106, 92), tick 0
//   slot 3  a second refinery of player 0 on (96, 70), tick 2600: capacity 1200
//   tick 4200  slot 3 is removed (Despawn): capacity 600 again, below what is stored
//
// What happens: the store fills to 600, the harvester in the bay keeps its load and waits there,
// the other queues behind it; the second refinery raises the capacity and the store fills to
// 1200; when it goes the capacity drops to 600, the 1200 stored are kept and nothing more is
// taken. tools/sf_headless/tests/storage.rs asserts those stages and the pinned checksum; CI runs
// the scenario on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in storage.expected.
Scenario(
    name: "storage",
    seed: 0x0007_0073,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("harvest_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian), (1, Veyran)],
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 600)]),
    ticks: 6000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 2, owner: 0, cell: (96, 86))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (104, 90))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (106, 92))),
        (tick: 2600, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 2, owner: 0, cell: (96, 70))),
        (tick: 4200, command: Despawn(ids: [Id(3, 0)])),
    ],
)
